    "result_text": "There's only one test class, and the full build is green (`BUILD SUCCESS`, 2/2 passing).\n\nThe change is complete. To satisfy the spec, I:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `ownerSegment` string property to the owner schema (the DTO is generated from this spec at build time), documenting the `<TIER>_<AREA>` format.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../model/OwnerSegment.java`** \u2014 new derivation class following the existing `MembershipLevel.of(owner)` / `Locality.of(owner)` pattern:\n   - `TIER` = `PREMIUM` when `MembershipLevel.of(owner) >= 3`, else `STANDARD`\n   - `AREA` = `METRO` when `Locality.of(owner)` is a known region, else `REGIONAL` (reusing the existing `Locality.UNKNOWN` sentinel, so NSW/VIC/QLD count as known)\n\n3. **`OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 wired `ownerSegment` to `OwnerSegment.of(owner)`.\n\nBoth acceptance tests (`STANDARD_METRO` for a Sydney/NSW owner at level 2, `STANDARD_REGIONAL` for an unknown-city owner) pass, and the full suite is green.",
